  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8909a7b854c460945b7273a620ed017e, type: 3}
  m_Name: PoI_02_Wen
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  speakerName: Wen
  characterAvatar: {fileID: 0}
  arrivalPrompt: You have arrived at the site.
  arrivalButtonText: Start
  dialogueLines:
  - "Visiting the Cathedral right before the earthquake, I\u2019ve always felt an
    almost mystical connection to this cathedral. "
  - Back in 2011, while staying with my homestay Susan as an international student,
    we came here just a week before the earthquake. The Cathedral Square was vibrant,
    and I could hear some music inside.
  - We only took a quick photo outside on the West Porch and didn't step in... I
    never imagined that would be my last chance for 15 years. I revisit here today
    not only to meet Susan, but also to check the place. I even brought that old
    2011 photo to show her.
  - "\u201CSince I never got to step inside back then... could you help me scan this
    porch to listen to the soundscape that was echoing inside? It was a weekend,
    so it could have been the choir practising, but I am not sure\u2026"
  alignmentPrompt: Position yourself to match the historical perspective.
  alignmentButtonText: I'm in Position
  interactionInstruction: 
  interactionButtonText: Got it
  reflectionPrompt: Take a moment to reflect on what you've just experienced.
  reflectionButtonText: Continue
